  "title": "The Water Monger, Lortha Peel",
  "description": "Into the palace walks the instantly undesirable water monger called Lortha Peel. Peel tells Boba Fett of the lack of respect that he is garnering as Mos Espa's new daimyo, purposefully slipping and dropping faux pas with nearly every turn of phrase. But Lortha is no fool; he has his own game to play and reveals so as he offers Fett double tribute to rid the streets of what he perceives to be a very troublesome gang. But things are not always as they seem."
